Turns the golem's skin into molten rock. The heat generated sets ablaze everything inside a radius of 3, doing [71, 96, 115, 131, 145 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage in 3 turns for [6, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] turns.

Burning is cumulative; the longer they stay within range, they higher the fire damage they take.

In addition the golem gains [64%, 76%, 85%, 93%, 100% (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire resistance.

Molten Skin damage will not affect friendly creatures.

The damage and resistance will increase with your Spellpower.
